nly zeros), if any, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -5 & -5 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 6 & -2 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry $c_{32}=-4$ is to the left of the leading entry $c_{23}=-4$ (condition II is violated).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $C$ is **not** in row echelon form."] [:db/add "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61" :question/answer-fields "bd9cbc5e-ee6a-5ea6-993b-3e03ce865ffc"] [:db/add "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61" :question/answer-fields "ec65bbef-45f3-5a41-9e73-331026443139"] [:db/add "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61" :question/answer-fields "b2cacdd6-af82-5d90-8c11-a86e9ee7f716"] [:db/ensure "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186129114 :knowledge-point/questions "302ba199-c600-5be2-9547-9762719dff61"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "4275eb9a-993a-53c8-95b3-5d0b6dc3b35f"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/4e/4e1eba0f732cf0f729ed800e713f9984e0e9187a3c8bd3e95d3d504bcef4d9a4/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186129114 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186129114 :knowledge-point/validate]]
